
### 1. Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health


### 2. Chat — new conversation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain prompt engineering in simple words."
}


### 3. Chat — continue a conversation
# Replace the ID below with the conversation_id returned by the previous request.
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Give me an example.",
  "conversation_id": "PASTE_CONVERSATION_ID_HERE"
}


### 4. Validation error — missing message
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversation_id": null
}


### 5. Streaming chat (SSE)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain prompt engineering in three short sentences."
}
